strings.KOM_coups_category_desc:
In order to ensure that our regime is stable, and we are not couped or counter-couped by our enemies, we must keep things as tightly under control as possible before we restore order. If our legitimacy reaches 0, we will be unable to maintain control, and a coup will be carried out. It will be critical to take all possible measures in order to prevent an overthrow of our order.

Our current legitimacy is {KOMCoupRisk} ({getkomcouplikelihood}). Our legitimacy will be reduced by {KOMCoupTicker} every day.

